From: RINNECODER <93304526+RINNECODER@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 22:22:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] DFlash 2 drafts for streamed Flint
 (LOCALS_DRAFTER=dflash)

incoai/Flint-DFlash2, ported from z-lab/dflash's MLX model: a 5-layer block
drafter (0.4B, bf16) that proposes 7 tokens in one pass from Flint's hidden
states at layers 5, 15, 26, 36, 46. FlintModel keeps a tape of those states
for one-row passes while it is on (the optimistic decode windows included);
a request's context is matched against the tape by token, so passes of other
rows or a restored prefix leave a gap. The draft replaces prompt lookup in
the solo path for unconstrained rows; lookup stays the default and for
grammars. LOCALS_DRAFTER=off turns drafts off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
